        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 24 at 5:29AM EDT until September 24 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 50 mph.

* WHERE...In Maryland, the Maryland Beaches. In North Carolina,
Eastern Currituck and Western Currituck Counties. In Virginia,
Northampton, Accomack, Norfolk, Portsmouth, and Virginia Beach.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
